    "Id": "vehicledef_BADGER_F",
    "Name": "Badger F",
    "Details": "A light tracked APC, the Badger was introduced to the Inner Sphere by Wolf's Dragoons. An Omni vehicle, it mounts a fusion engine and 6 tons of armor plate, with a 4 ton infantry bay and 5 tons of pod space for weapons. This version doubles the size of the infantry bay and carries a single ER medium laser in its turret.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 6/9 hexes / 180/270 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       120     15\n<b>Left</b>          90     15\n<b>Right</b>        90     15\n<b>Rear</b>         75     15\n<b>Turret</b>      100     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      475     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Protected Mechanisms</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 2 Battle Armor Squads. Has firing ports.</color>",
    "Icon": "Badger"
  },
